# entities

- Entity-scoped UI pieces, mappers, and small stores shared by multiple features.
- May depend on application, domain, DS UI/tokens, shared util/ng/i18n/state.
- **Must not** import `libs/features/*` or `libs/infra/*`.
- Do not put use cases here — those stay in `core/application`.
- Do not put pure domain entities here — those stay in `core/domain`.
- Keep public API small via `src/index.ts`.
- No models/lookup maps inside entity components — sibling `*.model.ts` / `*-maps.ts`.
- i18n + tokens for any visible text/styles.
